                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "classic fantasy action RPG in the hack’n’slash style, where you develop your hero, fight monsters, acquire equipment, and choose between the forces of nature and technology\n\n✅Equipment system collecting weapons, armor, and items, as well as trading with merchants\n✅Diverse locations, such as swamps, deserts, and caves\n✅Very good graphics for 2008, featuring detailed character, monster, and environment models, along with fluid animations\n✅ Character progression, the ability to level up, develop stats, and improve skills and spells\n✅Good price\n\n❌Poor difficulty balance and enemy scaling\n❌Some skills and spells do not function as described\n\n✅✅ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike], [strike] Bad [/strike], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [strike] Decent [/strike], [b] Good [/b], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for tested games and indie titles)\n\n[quote]If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand on my group:\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.\nI'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!\nBest regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
